  "description": "ThinkGeo.UI.Maui is the .NET MAUI MapView control for the ThinkGeo product line. It renders ThinkGeo.Core layers across iOS, Android, Windows, and Mac Catalyst with pan / zoom, popups, spatial drawing, and projection management.\n\nTargets: .NET 9 and .NET 10 for net{9,10}-android, net{9,10}-ios, net{9,10}-windows, net{9,10}-maccatalyst.\nPlatforms: iOS, Android, Windows, Mac Catalyst.\n\nDepends on ThinkGeo.Core. Pair with the ThinkGeo data extension packages (Gdal, NauticalCharts, etc.) for additional formats.\n\nSamples: https://gitlab.com/thinkgeo/public/thinkgeo-mobile-maps\n\nCommercial product with a free 30-day evaluation. Sign up at https://helpdesk.thinkgeo.com/register and download ProductCenter to start.\n\nDocumentation: https://docs.thinkgeo.com/",
